    <briefdescription>
<para>Layout manager for grid-based UI arrangement. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="classevab_1_1_grid" kindref="compound">Grid</ref> provides a fluent interface for organizing UI elements in a grid. Each <ref refid="classevab_1_1_grid_1a9cdd9b56bf792047f6e3139753a4e041" kindref="member">SliceRow()</ref>/SliceCol() returns a new <ref refid="classevab_1_1_grid" kindref="compound">Grid</ref> representing the cell.</para>
<para><programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal"><ref refid="classevab_1_1_grid_1a5e0a0e3d5fe200873b56ac92cee19d66" kindref="member">Grid</ref><sp/>mesh({0,0},<sp/>{16,8});</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">mesh.SliceRow(2).Draw(screen,<sp/>element1);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">mesh.SliceRow(2).SliceCol(2).Draw(screen,<sp/>element2);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">mesh.SliceRow(2).SliceCol(2).Clean(screen);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">mesh.Rest().Clean(screen);</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> </para>
    </detaileddescription>
